name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-11-21","period":"2025-09-30","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/857005/000119312525291326/ptc-20250930.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our customers are focused on improving their competitiveness in the face of global competition and increasing product complexity, and our suite of software offerings is a strategic enabler of this and their digital transformation initiatives. Given the breadth and openness of our portfolio, we enable the Intelligent Product Lifecycle: establishing a strong product data foundation in the engineering department and democratizing the access and use of that data across the enterprise to drive cross-functional collaboration, accelerate new product introduction timelines, and deliver higher product quality. By embracing the Intelligent Product Lifecycle, our customers establish the quality, consistency, and traceability of product data, ensuring the data is up-to-date, accessible, reliable, and actionable. Our customers can then go on to use this data to break down silos, streamline workflows,","zh":"面對全球競爭和不斷增加的產品複雜性，我們的客戶專注於提高競爭力，而我們的軟體產品套件是這一目標及其數位轉型計畫的策略推動者。鑑於我們產品組合的廣度和開放性，我們實現了智慧產品生命週期：在工程部門建立強大的產品資料基礎，並在整個企業內實現該資料的存取和使用民主化，以推動跨職能協作、加快新產品推出時間表並提供更高的產品品質。透過採用智慧產品生命週期，我們的客戶建立了產品資料的品質、一致性和可追溯性，確保資料是最新的、可存取的、可靠的和可操作的。然後，我們的客戶可以繼續使用這些數據來打破孤島，簡化工作流程，"},{"en":"Our business is based on a subscription model and 95% of our 2025 revenue is recurring in nature. Compared to a perpetual license model, our subscription model naturally drives higher customer engagement and retention and provides better business predictability. This, in turn, enables us to make steady and sustained investments to support our customers and pursue mid-to-long-term growth opportunities.","zh":"我們的業務基於訂閱模式，2025 年 95% 的收入本質上是經常性的。與永久授權模式相比，我們的訂閱模式自然會提高客戶參與度和保留率，並提供更好的業務可預測性。這反過來又使我們能夠進行穩定、持續的投資，以支持我們的客戶並尋求中長期成長機會。"},{"en":"Our Windchill PLM application suite manages all aspects of the product development lifecycle—from concept through service and end-of-life. Windchill provides real-time information sharing, dynamic data visualization, and the ability to collaborate across geographically distributed teams, enabling manufacturers to elevate their product development, manufacturing, field service, and end-of-life processes.","zh":"我們的 Windchill PLM 應用程式套件管理產品開發生命週期的各個方面 - 從概念到服務再到生命週期結束。 Windchill 提供即時資訊共享、動態資料視覺化以及跨地理分佈團隊協作的能力，使製造商能夠提升其產品開發、製造、現場服務和報廢流程。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We aim to create value for our customers, increase our Annual Run Rate (ARR) and cash flow, and deliver long-term value for shareholders. We focus our resources and attention on the solutions described above, where we believe we can create the greatest customer value.","zh":"我們的目標是為客戶創造價值，提高年運行率（ARR）和現金流，並為股東創造長期價值。我們將資源和注意力集中在上述解決方案上，我們相信我們可以創造最大的客戶價值。"},{"en":"Our growth is primarily driven by existing customers that continue to upgrade and expand their PTC footprint, multi-product adoption by customers, our commercial optimization initiatives, and new customers.","zh":"我們的成長主要由持續升級和擴大其 PTC 業務範圍的現有客戶、客戶對多產品的採用、我們的商業優化計劃以及新客戶推動。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our business is based on a subscription model and 95% of our 2025 revenue is recurring in nature. Compared to a perpetual license model, our subscription model naturally drives higher customer engagement and retention and provides better business predictability. This, in turn, enables us to make steady and sustained investments to support our customers and pursue mid-to-long-term growth opportunities.","zh":"我們的業務基於訂閱模式，2025 年 95% 的收入本質上是經常性的。與永久授權模式相比，我們的訂閱模式自然會提高客戶參與度和保留率，並提供更好的業務可預測性。這反過來又使我們能夠進行穩定、持續的投資，以支持我們的客戶並尋求中長期成長機會。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete with a number of companies whose offerings address one or more specific functional areas covered by our solutions. For enterprise CAD and PLM solutions, we compete with large established companies including Autodesk, Dassault Syst mes SA, and Siemens AG. For our ALM products, we compete with IBM, Jama Software, Inc. and Siemens AG. For our SLM products, we compete with enterprise software companies such as Oracle, SAP, IFS AB, Microsoft, and Salesforce, and with companies that offer point solutions.","zh":"我們與許多公司競爭，這些公司的產品解決了我們的解決方案所涵蓋的一個或多個特定功能領域。對於企業 CAD 和 PLM 解決方案，我們與 Autodesk、Dassault Syst mes SA 和西門子 AG 等大型老牌公司競爭。對於我們的 ALM 產品，我們與 IBM、Jama Software, Inc. 和西門子 AG 競爭。對於我們的 SLM 產品，我們與 Oracle、SAP、IFS AB、Microsoft 和 Salesforce 等企業軟體公司以及提供單點解決方案的公司競爭。"},{"en":"Our software products and related technical know-how, along with our trademarks, including our company names, product names and logos, are proprietary. We protect our intellectual property rights in these items by relying on copyrights, trademarks, patents and common law safeguards, including trade secret protection. The nature and extent of such legal protection depends in part on the type of intellectual property right and the relevant jurisdiction. In the U.S., we are generally able to maintain our trademark registrations for as long as the trademarks are in use and to maintain our patents for up to 20 years from the earliest effective filing date. We also use license management and other anti-piracy technology measures, as well as contractual restrictions, to curtail the unauthorized use and distribution of our products.","zh":"我們的軟體產品和相關技術知識以及我們的商標（包括我們的公司名稱、產品名稱和標誌）都是專有的。我們依靠版權、商標、專利和普通法保障措施（包括商業機密保護）來保護這些項目的智慧財產權。此類法律保護的性質和範圍部分取決於智慧財產權的類型和相關司法管轄區。在美國，只要商標在使用中，我們通常能夠維持我們的商標註冊，並且自最早有效申請日起最多 20 年維持我們的專利。我們還使用許可證管理和其他反盜版技術措施以及合約限制來減少未經授權的使用和分發我們的產品。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Recurring Services","val":2600514000,"zh":"經常性服務"},{"name":"Product Lifecycle Management","val":1741310000,"zh":"產品生命週期管理"},{"name":"Computer Aided Design","val":997916000,"zh":"電腦輔助設計"},{"name":"Perpetual License","val":31375000,"zh":"永久許可"}],"total":2739226000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-30","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":1327229000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":1287500000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":995094000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":416903000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"DE","val":368800000,"zh":"德國"}],"total":2739226000}},"peers":["TYL","CDW","TRMB","IT","SSNC"]}}